💭 Prints what the package makes of a file, so that tools that are not ours can be
💭 asked for the same. It imports the package as any program would. Built into
💭 build/bin/crypto-tool.
💭
💭   crypto-tool sha256 <file>             the file's SHA-256, as hex
💭   crypto-tool hmac <key file> <file>    the file's HMAC-SHA-256 under the bytes of the key file, as hex
💭   crypto-tool hmacs <key file> <file>   the same, made a thousand times over: for seeing how long one takes
